          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Outcome</span><span class="info-stat-val"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/china">China</a>’s first modern arsenals, shipyards, mines, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/telegraph">telegraphs</a> and technical schools and a modern navy, but no reform of institutions; defeat by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/japan">Japan</a> in 1894–1895 discredited it</span></div>
